  "body": "`transferFromImageBitmap` is a redundant name. It should just be `transfer`.\r\n\r\nAlso, the only parameter currently allowed is an `ImageBitmap`. Renaming it to `transfer` would mean that it could theoretically take other objects in the future (as unlikely as that may be).",
